# DB Package (`@lyterion/db`)

## Schema

- One file per domain in `src/schema/`, re-exported from `src/schema/index.ts`
- Table names snake_case, columns snake_case in SQL and camelCase in TS
- Index foreign keys and common filter columns
- Upserts use `conflictValue(col)` from `src/index.ts` in `onConflictDoUpdate`

## Migrations

- Change the schema, then `pnpm db:generate`. Never hand-write or edit migration SQL
- Local dev can use `pnpm db:push`
- Migrations run on api container start in the homelab (GitHub runners can't reach the LAN database)

## Client

`db` is drizzle on `pg` with a single pool from `LYTERION_DATABASE_URL`.
